SUMMARY:Christian Johnson LIVE at Milwaukee Improv (Main Room)
DTSTAMP:20260708T050906Z
DTSTART:20260709T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nChristian
	 Johnson is a rising star in the stand-up comedy world\, best known for hi
	s viral character “Uncle Nathaniel” — the lovably dramatic\, over-the-top 
	relative we all have in our family. His catchphrase “Lord Have Mer-Say” ha
	s taken the internet by storm\, earning him over 2.5 million followers acr
	oss social media platforms. \nKnown for his refreshing clean comedy\, cont
	agious energy\, and unique storytelling style\, Christian Johnson brings a
	 high-energy performance that resonates with audiences of all backgrounds.
	 He has shared the stage with countless celebrity comics and has toured na
	tionally and internationally\, cementing his place as one of the most exci
	ting comedians to watch right now. \nExpect relatable humor\, hilarious ch
	aracter work\, and a show that will have you quoting lines long after you 
	leave the venue. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, July 9\, 2026\nShow T
	ime: 7:00 PM CDT (Doors open at 5:30 PM)\nVenue: Milwaukee Improv (Main Ro
	om)\nAddress: 20110 Lower Union Street\, Brookfield\, WI 53045\nAge Restri
	ction: 21+ (Valid ID required)\nContent: Clean comedy — suitable for all a
	dult audiences\n\nPlease note: There is a mandatory two-item minimum purch
	ase per person in the showroom. No cell phone use\, photography\, or video
	 recording is permitted during the performance. All sales are final. \nAbo
	ut the Venue\nThe Milwaukee Improv (Main Room) is one of the premier comed
	y clubs in the Midwest\, located at 20110 Lower Union Street in Brookfield
	\, Wisconsin — just minutes west of downtown Milwaukee. Part of the nation
	ally recognized Improv comedy club chain\, the Milwaukee Improv has hosted
	 some of the biggest names in stand-up comedy. \nThe Main Room features a 
	classic comedy club atmosphere with general admission seating\, premium bo
	oths\, and VIP options. The venue has a full-service bar and kitchen\, wit
	h a two-item minimum per guest in the showroom. Seating is first-come\, fi
	rst-served for general admission\, with reserved options available for gro
	ups and premium booth holders. \nThe club has a capacity that creates an i
	ntimate\, up-close experience with the performer — perfect for a night of 
	laughs. Parking is available on-site at the venue. The atmosphere is livel
	y and welcoming\, making it a great destination for date nights\, group ou
	tings\, or solo comedy fans. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo stand-up com
	edy show featuring Christian Johnson as the headliner. Expect a full eveni
	ng of high-energy\, clean stand-up comedy with Christian’s signature chara
	cter work\, viral bits\, and crowd interaction. \nThe show runs approximat
	ely 90 minutes including any opening acts. Doors open at 5:30 PM\, so arri
	ve early to grab your seats and enjoy the full experience. The intimate se
	tting of the Milwaukee Improv Main Room means every seat is a great seat —
	 you’ll feel like you’re right in the middle of the action. \nThis is a 21
	+ event\, so bring a valid photo ID. The two-item minimum applies to all g
	uests in the showroom\, so plan to enjoy food and drinks while you laugh t
	he night away. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $25 – $90 (plus fees) \n
	\nGA Ticket: $25 (+ fees)\nVIP Ticket: $40 (+ fees)\nGA Booth for 4: $75/t
	icket (+ fees) — includes $200 food & beverage credit\nVIP Premium Booth f
	or 4: $90/ticket (+ fees) — includes $200 food & beverage credit\n\nGet yo
	ur tickets now before they sell out — only limited seats remain! \nOfficia
	l TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn 
	a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/
	christian-johnson-live-at-milwaukee-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/christian-johnson-live-at-milwaukee-im
	prov/
LOCATION:Milwaukee Improv (Main Room)\, 20110 Lower Union Street\, Brookfie
	ld\, WI\, 53045\, USA
