DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nAdam Caro
	lla is a multi-hyphenate entertainer — stand-up comedian\, podcast pioneer
	\, author\, and television personality — best known for his sharp\, opinio
	nated humor and rapid-fire delivery. \nHe rose to fame as co-host of Lovel
	ine and The Man Show\, and later became a podcasting legend with The Adam 
	Carolla Show\, which held the Guinness World Record for most downloaded po
	dcast. \nCarolla’s stand-up is unapologetically direct\, blending personal
	 anecdotes\, social commentary\, and blue-collar wisdom into a high-energy
	 performance that keeps audiences laughing from start to finish. \nEvent D
	etails\n\nDate: Thursday\, July 9\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM (doors open e
	arlier)\nVenue: Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club\, 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las V
	egas\, NV 89109\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event\nTicket Prices: From $49\n\nAb
	out the Venue\nJimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club is one of the premier comedy des
	tinations on the Las Vegas Strip\, located on the iconic LINQ Promenade at
	 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd. \nThe intimate venue seats approximately 300 guest
	s and features a state-of-the-art sound system\, excellent sightlines from
	 every seat\, and full bar service throughout the show. \nThe club’s cozy 
	atmosphere creates an up-close-and-personal comedy experience unlike the l
	arge arena shows Vegas is known for. Parking is available at the LINQ Hote
	l parking garage\, and the venue is easily accessible via the Las Vegas Mo
	norail. \nThe LINQ Promenade itself offers a variety of dining and enterta
	inment options before and after the show\, making it a perfect evening des
	tination on the Strip. \nWhat to Expect\nAdam Carolla delivers a headline 
	solo stand-up performance filled with his trademark rapid-fire wit\, perso
	nal stories\, and unfiltered takes on modern life. \nExpect a high-energy\
	, laugh-out-loud show where Carolla’s natural charisma and decades of come
	dic experience shine through. His sets are known for their conversational 
	flow and ability to make even controversial topics hilarious. \nThis is a 
	must-see for fans of smart\, opinionated comedy in an intimate Las Vegas c
	lub setting. Arrive early to grab a drink and the best seats in the house.
	 \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $49 and are available through of
	ficial and resale channels. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post c
	ontains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
