DTSTAMP:20260708T050906Z
DTSTART:20260709T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Dave Smith\nDave Smith i
	s a stand-up comedian who channels headline-level clarity into club-ready 
	punchlines\, building high-velocity sets that fuse political curiosity\, o
	ff-the-cuff crowd play\, and meticulous craft. Known for taking apart hot-
	button ideas and inviting the audience into the argument\, Dave sticks the
	 landing with tags that cut and charm in equal measure. \nHis onstage voic
	e is candid and quick — the kind that can pivot from a precise premise to 
	a fearless riff without losing control. He released his comedy special Lib
	ertas in 2017 and has been a fixture on the national comedy circuit ever s
	ince. If you want jokes that interrogate the moment without losing the lau
	gh\, Dave Smith delivers heat\, wit\, and a surprising amount of heart. \n
	Event Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 9\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM\nVenue: 
	Punch Line Houston\nAddress: 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX 77002\nAg
	e Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum\nTicket Price: From $28 \nAbout Pu
	nch Line Houston\nPunch Line Houston is downtown Houston’s premier stand-u
	p comedy club\, located at 1204 Caroline Street. Part of the nationally re
	cognized Punch Line Comedy Club brand\, this intimate venue delivers an up
	-close comedy experience that puts you right in the action. \nThe club fea
	tures table seating\, a full-service bar\, and a two-drink minimum. The in
	timate setting is ideal for Dave’s sharp\, thought-provoking comedy style.
	 Parking is available in nearby downtown Houston garages. \nWhat to Expect
	\nDave Smith’s live show is a masterclass in political and observational c
	omedy. He builds arguments like a lawyer and delivers punchlines like a pr
	o — every set is tight\, fast\, and packed with ideas that make you think 
	as much as they make you laugh. Expect crowd interaction\, fearless takes\
	, and a room that’s fully engaged from the first minute. \nDave is perform
	ing a full weekend run at Punch Line Houston — Thursday July 9 at 7:30 PM\
	, Friday July 10 at 7:00 PM and 9:15 PM\, and Saturday July 11 at 7:00 PM.
	 This is an 18+ event with a two-beverage minimum per guest. \nTicket Info
	rmation\nPrice: From $28\nTickets available via Ticketmaster (official) or
	 VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contain
	s affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nht
	tps://comedycalendar.com/event/dave-smith-live-at-punch-line-houston/\n\nF
	rom Comedy Calendar
