DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nDulcé Sloan is one of the most exciting voices in stand-up comedy tod
	ay. Known for her bold\, unapologetic humor and razor-sharp wit\, she has 
	become a fan favorite on the comedy circuit and a recognizable face on tel
	evision. \nSloan is best known as a correspondent on Comedy Central’s The 
	Daily Show\, where her fearless commentary and comedic timing have earned 
	her widespread acclaim. Her stand-up style blends personal storytelling\, 
	social commentary\, and high-energy delivery that keeps audiences laughing
	 from start to finish. \nWith a background rooted in Atlanta’s vibrant com
	edy scene\, Dulcé brings an authentic Southern perspective to her material
	. She tackles topics ranging from race and gender to everyday absurdities 
	of modern life — all with a confidence and charisma that is entirely her o
	wn. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 9\, 2026 \nTime: 7:30 PM \nVenu
	e: Punch Line Irving\, 310 W Las Colinas Blvd.\, Suite 130\, Irving\, TX 7
	5039 \nAge Restriction: 18+ with 2-beverage minimum \nAdditional Dates: Al
	so performing July 10 (7:00 PM & 9:15 PM) and July 11 (7:00 PM & 9:15 PM) 
	\nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Irving is one of the Dallas-Fort Worth area’
	s premier comedy clubs\, located in the heart of the Las Colinas entertain
	ment district in Irving\, Texas. Part of the nationally recognized Punch L
	ine Comedy Club brand\, this venue offers an intimate\, club-style atmosph
	ere perfect for experiencing stand-up comedy up close. \nThe club features
	 a full bar and dining service\, with a 2-beverage minimum per guest. The 
	seating is general admission style\, giving audiences a relaxed and social
	 environment to enjoy the show. The venue is conveniently located near the
	 Toyota Music Factory entertainment complex\, with ample parking available
	 in the surrounding area. \nWith a capacity designed for an up-close comed
	y experience\, Punch Line Irving ensures every seat has a great view of th
	e stage. The venue regularly hosts nationally touring headliners and is a 
	must-visit destination for comedy fans in the DFW metroplex. \nWhat to Exp
	ect\nDulcé Sloan’s live show is a high-energy\, no-holds-barred comedy exp
	erience. Expect sharp observations\, hilarious personal anecdotes\, and th
	e kind of fearless humor that has made her one of the most talked-about co
	medians working today. \nThe show runs approximately 75–90 minutes and is 
	intended for adult audiences (18+). Guests are encouraged to arrive early 
	to secure good seats\, enjoy dinner and drinks\, and settle in before the 
	show begins. The 2-beverage minimum is included in the ticket price. \nWhe
	ther you’re a longtime fan of her work on The Daily Show or discovering Du
	lcé Sloan for the first time\, this is a live comedy experience you won’t 
	want to miss. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $27 – $50 (plus fees) \nT
	ickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resal
	e). Purchase early as shows at Punch Line Irving sell out quickly. \nOffic
	ial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may ear
