SUMMARY:Patrick Warburton LIVE at Laugh Factory Las Vegas
DTSTAMP:20260708T050907Z
DTSTART:20260710T183000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nPatrick W
	arburton is a beloved actor and comedian best known for his iconic roles a
	s David Puddy on Seinfeld\, Joe Swanson on Family Guy\, and Kronk in The E
	mperor’s New Groove. With his distinctive deep voice and deadpan delivery\
	, Warburton has become one of the most recognizable comedic presences in H
	ollywood. \nOn stage\, Patrick brings the same dry wit and effortless char
	m that has made him a fan favorite on screen. His stand-up comedy is obser
	vational\, self-deprecating\, and delivered with the kind of confident tim
	ing that only comes from decades of performing. Audiences love his ability
	 to find humor in everyday situations while maintaining his signature larg
	er-than-life persona. \nSeeing Patrick Warburton live at the Laugh Factory
	 in Las Vegas is a rare treat — an opportunity to experience one of Hollyw
	ood’s most beloved comedic talents in an intimate club setting. \nEvent De
	tails\n\nDate: Friday\, July 10\, 2026\nTime: 6:30 PM\nVenue: Laugh Factor
	y at Horseshoe Las Vegas\, 3645 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nS
	how Duration: Approximately 90 minutes\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Laugh Facto
	ry at Horseshoe Las Vegas is one of the most storied comedy club brands in
	 the world\, bringing its legendary Hollywood comedy experience to the hea
	rt of the Las Vegas Strip. Located inside the iconic Horseshoe Las Vegas a
	t 3645 S Las Vegas Blvd\, this venue has hosted some of the biggest names 
	in stand-up comedy. \nThe club features a classic comedy club layout with 
	tiered seating\, excellent sightlines\, and a full bar service. The intima
	te atmosphere creates a personal connection between performer and audience
	 that larger venues simply can’t replicate. With a capacity of several hun
	dred guests\, every seat feels close to the stage. \nThe Horseshoe Las Veg
	as is conveniently located on the Strip with easy access to parking and pu
	blic transportation. The venue is a must-visit for comedy fans looking for
	 a world-class show in a classic club setting. \nWhat to Expect\nPatrick W
	arburton’s Las Vegas show is a stand-up performance showcasing his signatu
	re deadpan humor\, Hollywood stories\, and sharp observational comedy. Exp
	ect an evening filled with laughs from start to finish\, delivered by a pe
	rformer who has been making audiences laugh for decades. \nThe show runs a
	pproximately 90 minutes and may include an opening act. The intimate setti
	ng of the Laugh Factory creates an electric atmosphere where Patrick’s nat
	ural charisma and comedic timing shine brightest. Fans of his TV and film 
	work will love seeing a different\, more personal side of this comedy lege
	nd. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $40 – $74 (fees may apply) \nTicket
	s are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale mar
	ketplace). Patrick Warburton shows are popular — book early to secure your
	 seats! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate li
	nks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedyca
	lendar.com/event/patrick-warburton-live-at-laugh-factory-las-vegas/\n\nFro
	m Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/patrick-warburton-live-at-laugh-factor
	y-las-vegas/
LOCATION:Laugh Factory at Horseshoe Las Vegas\, 3645 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las
	 Vegas\, NV\, 89109\, USA
