SUMMARY:Killers of Kill Tony LIVE at Linda Ronstadt Music Hall
DTSTAMP:20260708T050907Z
DTSTART:20260710T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Killers of Kill Tony\nKi
	llers of Kill Tony is the live touring spinoff of the massively popular Ki
	ll Tony podcast\, hosted by Tony Hinchcliffe. The show features a rotating
	 lineup of the podcast’s most beloved and breakout comedians performing fu
	ll stand-up sets. \nKnown for launching the careers of numerous rising sta
	rs\, Kill Tony has become one of the most influential platforms in comedy.
	 The Killers tour brings the best of that world to theaters and music hall
	s across the country. \nThis Tucson edition features David Lucas\, Timmy N
	o Brakes\, Martin Phillips\, and Dedrick Flynn — a stacked lineup of some 
	of the funniest comedians in the game right now. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: 
	Friday\, July 10\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:00 PM\nVenue: Linda Ronstadt Music H
	all\, 260 South Church Avenue\, Tucson\, AZ 85701\nSeating: Reserved Seati
	ng\nTicket Prices: Starting from $57+\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Linda Ronsta
	dt Music Hall is one of Tucson’s premier entertainment venues\, located in
	 the heart of downtown at the Tucson Convention Center complex. \nNamed in
	 honor of Tucson’s own legendary singer Linda Ronstadt\, the hall seats ap
	proximately 2\,300 guests and offers excellent sightlines from virtually e
	very seat in the house. \nThe venue features a warm\, intimate atmosphere 
	with comfortable seating\, great acoustics\, and a full-service bar. Parki
	ng is available in the adjacent Convention Center garage and nearby surfac
	e lots. \nWhat to Expect\nThe Killers of Kill Tony show is a high-energy\,
	 multi-comedian stand-up event that showcases some of the most exciting vo
	ices in comedy today. \nFans of the Kill Tony podcast will love seeing the
	ir favorite comedians perform full sets in a proper theater setting. Newco
	mers will discover why this show has become one of the hottest tickets in 
	comedy. Expect big laughs\, great energy\, and a night to remember. \nTick
	et Information\nTickets start at $57+ and are available through Ticketmast
	er (official) and VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \n
	This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra c
	ost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/killers-of-kill-tony-at-li
	nda-ronstadt-music-hall/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/killers-of-kill-tony-at-linda-ronstadt
	-music-hall/
LOCATION:Linda Ronstadt Music Hall\, 260 South Church Avenue\, Tucson\, AZ\
	, 85701\, USA
